---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ThemeToggle from '../components/ThemeToggle.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="About - Filip Mares"
    description="Principal Software Engineer at Microsoft. Previously founding engineer at Talko and Web Engineering Lead at Pulse."
    ogUrl="https://filipmares.com/about"
>
    <nav class="navbar" aria-label="Page navigation" slot="nav">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line>
                <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Index
        </a>
        <ThemeToggle />
    </nav>

    <main class="container">
        <h1>About</h1>

        <div class="about-grid">
            <div class="photo-wrapper">
                <img src="/profile.jpg" alt="Filip Mares" class="profile-photo" width="400" height="533" loading="eager" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
                <div class="photo-placeholder-text">Replace with profile.jpg<br>(3:4 aspect ratio recommended)</div>
            </div>

            <div class="bio-content">
                <p>I am a Principal Software Engineer at Microsoft, currently based in the San Francisco Bay Area. My work is heavily focused on the intersection of human-computer interaction, artificial intelligence, and low-code platforms.</p>

                <p>Most recently, I've been building App Builder within Microsoft 365 Copilot, focusing on giving users an intuitive, agentic experience to create secure and sharable productivity apps at an enterprise scale.</p>

                <p>Prior to this, I led the development of Power Apps App Copilot and multiplayer collaboration capabilities. I also guided the front-end team for Lobe—a project incubated in the Office of the CTO aimed at democratizing machine learning through an accessible visual interface.</p>

                <p>Before my tenure at Microsoft, I was a founding engineer at Talko (acquired by Microsoft) and the Web Engineering Lead at Pulse (acquired by LinkedIn).</p>

                <div class="bio-meta">
                    <div class="meta-block">
                        <span class="meta-label">Location</span>
                        <span class="meta-value">San Francisco Bay Area, CA</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="meta-block">
                        <span class="meta-label">Expertise</span>
                        <span class="meta-value">React, TypeScript, LLMs, System Architecture</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    main.container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 3.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.04em;
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        view-transition-name: about-link;
    }

    /* Editorial Split Layout */
    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
        gap: 4rem;
        align-items: start;
    }

    /* Photo Integration */
    .photo-wrapper {
        position: relative;
    }

    .photo-wrapper::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 1rem;
        left: -1rem;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        border-radius: 4px;
        z-index: 0;
    }

    .profile-photo {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        aspect-ratio: 3/4;
        object-fit: cover;
        border-radius: 4px;
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.1) brightness(0.95);
        mix-blend-mode: multiply;
        background-color: var(--photo-placeholder);
        display: block;
    }

    :global(:root.dark-theme) .profile-photo {
        mix-blend-mode: normal;
        opacity: 0.85;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :global(:root:not(.light-theme)) .profile-photo {
            mix-blend-mode: normal;
            opacity: 0.85;
        }
    }

    .photo-placeholder-text {
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        z-index: 2;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-align: center;
        pointer-events: none;
    }

    .bio-content {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        color: var(--text-main);
    }

    .bio-content p {
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .bio-meta {
        margin-top: 3rem;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .meta-block {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .meta-label {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .meta-value {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
        .about-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .photo-wrapper {
            max-width: 300px;
        }
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }
        .bio-meta {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>
